        <hasBearer rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ontodesire#Nora"/>
        <hasContent rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ontodesire#noraTriesNewTeas"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Nora&apos;s standing desire to try new teas</rdfs:label>
        <skos:note xml:lang="en">Example of the explanatory role of standing desires: explains why the new tin captures her attention and why she is delighted. No strength individual is asserted: under v0.3.0&apos;s max-1 axiom a desire need not carry a determinate cardinal strength.</skos:note>
